    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"necessary urban evolution\"... that sounds pretty definitive. do you think there's a \"right\" amount of density for a city, or is it basically just a matter of whatever the current residents want? i'm trying to figure out if there's a standard to aim for or if i'm just fighting a losing battle against people who don't want change.",
